{"id":"en_from-mudblood-to-atlantis-owner","title":"From Mudblood to Atlantis' Owner","titleEn":"From Mudblood to Atlantis' Owner","description":"In Atlantis, only godblood mermaids are permitted to live, while mudbloods are killed at birth. Princess Rosalie is secretly a mudblood, concealed by her mother's dark magic. On the day she gives birth, her husband Xavier learns the truth and kills her. Reborn, Rosalie rejects Xavier and instead chooses to marry a mute slave, a decision that draws mockery and claims that she has lost her mind. What the others do not realize is that the slave is no ordinary servant: he carries Pure Godblood, the rarest and most powerful bloodline in Atlantis.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/c8bbf3e0ec7fb05b/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/c8bbf3e0ec7fb05b/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Comeback","Sweet Romance","Superpower","Revenge","Hidden Identity"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4168/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_from-mudblood-to-atlantis-owner_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4168/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_from-mudblood-to-atlantis-owner_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4168/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_from-mudblood-to-atlantis-owner_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d4168/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_from-mudblood-to-atlantis-owner_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0",